  "purpose": "Probe an independent official MINAM public hydrography layer for Rio Seco candidate linework inside the already-preregistered coarse Jicamarca documentary window. Returned linework is candidate-only and cannot define channel identity, catchment, outlet, confluence, routing, event footprint, threshold, risk state or alert until a separate frozen outcome-independent identity/topology review passes.",
  "source": {
    "institution": "Ministerio del Ambiente del Peru",
    "publication_host": "Geoservidor MINAM",
